      "quote": "Haverhill’s final city election takes place Tuesday Nov. 4, 2025. If a preliminary election is required to whittle down the number of candidates in any race, it will take place Tuesday, Sept. 9.",
      "note": "The held return is headed GENERAL ELECTION - NOV 2025 UNOFFICIAL RESULTS, which gives the month and withholds the day, which is why the gate could not date it. This quote also settles preliminary against general in one sentence, and the city own results index lists the two separately: Municipal General Election Nov 2025 - OFFICIAL RESULTS and Preliminary Municipal Election Sept 2025 - Official Results - Ward 4 and Ward 6. The Eagle Tribune story Haverhill re-elects Melinda Barrett for mayor, election results is datelined Nov 4, 2025, a post-election witness to the same day. The citys own 2025 election calendar page renders to 1253 characters of navigation chrome with no body, so it is UNCHECKED rather than empty."
    }
